  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">BCECE Admission 2nd Round Allotment Result 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-08-11T11:52:14+05:30\">August 11, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">11:52 am</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB)</a>\u00a0</strong>has released the <strong>2nd\u00a0Round Allotment Result</strong>\u00a0on its <strong>official website</strong> for <strong data-end=\"283\" data-start=\"264\">BCECE 2026</strong>, which offers <strong>Engineering, Medical, Pharmacy and Agriculture Stream Courses</strong>. The\u00a0<strong>exam</strong> was conducted from <strong>30 \u2013</strong> <strong data-end=\"430\" data-start=\"398\">31 May 2026</strong>. The\u00a0<strong data-end=\"469\" data-start=\"436\">BCECE application process</strong>\u00a0started on\u00a0<strong data-end=\"498\" data-start=\"481\">15 April 2026</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their Application until\u00a0<strong data-end=\"576\" data-start=\"559\">05 May 2026</strong>. Candidates can check their <strong>Counselling/ Choice Filling</strong><strong>\u00a0</strong>using their\u00a0<strong data-end=\"704\" data-start=\"644\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>\u00a0by logging into the<strong>\u00a0portal.</strong>\u00a0The\u00a0<strong>direct link</strong>\u00a0is provided below.</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .whatsapp {\n            background-color: #25D366;\n        }\n        .whatsapp:hover {\n            background-color: #1EBE57;\n        }\n        .telegram {\n            background-color: #0088cc;\n        }\n        .telegram:hover {\n            background-color: #0078b8;\n        }\n        .icon {\n            margin-right: 8px;\n        }\n    </style></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a class=\"apply-button\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n</div>\n<style>\n        /* Button Style */\n        .apply-button {\n            text-align:center;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 15px 30px;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: red;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-align: center;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n    \n    </style>\n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> Telegram </a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">BCECE Admission 2026 2nd Round Allotment Result</h2>\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">BCECE Examination 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bcece-admission-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <b>15 April 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b> 05 May 2026</b></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date Online Payment :\u00a0<b>06 May 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Correction Date : <strong>07-08 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>30-31 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card Available<span style=\"color: #000000;\"> :\u00a0<b>22 May 2026</b></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Declared Date :<b> 24 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Counselling/ Choice Filling :\u00a019-25 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>For PCM/ PCB/ CBA/ PCA/ MBA/ MCA Group</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>General, BC, EBC</strong>\u00a0: <b><strong>\u20b9\u00a0</strong>1000/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC/ ST/ DQ</strong>\u00a0: <b><strong>\u20b9 </strong></b><strong>500/<br/>\n</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>For PCMB Group</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>General, BC, EBC</strong>\u00a0: <b><strong>\u20b9\u00a0</strong>1100/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC/ ST/ DQ</strong>\u00a0: <b><strong>\u20b9 </strong></b><strong>550/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong>\u00a0You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">BCECE Admission Online Form 2026 : Age Limits As On 31 December 2026</h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age :\u00a0<strong>16 Years </strong>(For <strong>Agriculture Stream</strong>) as on <strong>31 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age\u00a0<strong>: 17 Years </strong>(For <strong>Pharmacy &amp; Medical Stream</strong>) as on <strong>31/12/2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :\u00a0<strong>No Age Limit</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Check More Details For BCECE 2026 Visit Official Website.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">N/A</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"6d52a8db4af002483566167d-text/javascript\"></script>\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9762662687323163\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7596594071\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display:block\"></ins>\n<script type=\"6d52a8db4af002483566167d-text/javascript\">\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a class=\"apply-button\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n</div>\n<style>\n        /* Button Style */\n        .apply-button {\n            text-align:center;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 15px 30px;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: red;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-align: center;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n    \n    </style>\n</div>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"6d52a8db4af002483566167d-text/javascript\"></script>\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9762662687323163\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7596594071\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display:block\"></ins>\n<script type=\"6d52a8db4af002483566167d-text/javascript\">\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">BCECE Online Form 2026 : Admission Details</h6>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.3856%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Exam Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.6144%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Education Qualification</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.3856%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"230\">\u00a0\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">BCECE 2026</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.6144%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Pharmacy Stream : </strong>Candidates must have <strong>passed or appeared in 10+2</strong> (or equivalent) with Physics and Chemistry as compulsory subjects and either Mathematics or Biology as an optional subject.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Medical Stream : </strong>Candidates must have<strong> passed or appeared in 10+2</strong> (or equivalent) with <strong>English, Physics, Chemistry, and Biology</strong> as subjects.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><strong>Agriculture Stream : </strong></strong>Candidates must have<strong> passed I.Sc or I.Sc in Agriculture</strong>, as per the seat requirements of the respective college.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/ofss-bihar-11th-admissions-2026/\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #000000;\" target=\"_blank\">OFSS Bihar 11th Admissions Online Form 2026</a></span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0How To Check &amp; Download BCECE Result / Rank Card 2026\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the official<strong> BCECE Board website.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, click on the <strong>\u201cBCECE Result / Rank Card 2026\u201d</strong> link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Enter your <strong>Registration Number/Application Number and Password/Date of Birth.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Fill in the <strong>Captcha Code carefully.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the Login/Submit button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Your Result / Rank Card will appear on the screen.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download the <strong>Result / Rank Card\u00a0PDF</strong> for future reference.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<